      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This ticket is related. https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/expose-camera-and-menu-open-status-to-udon Also unable to differentiate whether the player's pointer is interacting with the world or their personal mirror or VRChat (handheld) camera.",
