      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Was going to write \"would ... want ...\" but I actually need this. It is an unnecessary fuss coding around a very simple function, which does not exist but would make things A LOT easier to handle.\n\nI have a custom world menu for my world, and it is a nightmare calculating a perfect usable function, whenever the joystick is being used or whatever, without triggering my own UI.\n\nIt's been more than 2 years now, that this function is still not being made publicly available to use for world devs ... it ain't that hard making sources available to us, VRChat ...",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
